  "notes": "Apply index 12 of the ledger. GALHQGPV\u2026 calls approve on the testnet native asset contract CDLZFC3S\u2026 for 12345678 stroops until ledger 5377326; the contract creates a temporary Allowance entry keyed by from and spender, and emits one approve event. The spender is the account GCRX37M4\u2026, whose own entries do not change. The fee events charge 126234 (stage before_all_txs) and refund -20134 (stage after_all_txs): fee_charged 106100. Written live by stellar-core 29.0.0. Testnet is reset on 2026-12-16; the vendored object will then be the only copy."
